  "seed": 20261005
 },
 "unit": "library; GSE290297 declares no animal field",
 "why_the_expression_matched_null": "A compositional consequence of TPM renormalisation is a function of a gene's expression level, so a null drawn with the gene set's own AveExpr-decile composition absorbs it. A programme exceeding that null is not a renormalisation artefact; a programme inside it is uninformative rather than confounded. This is the correction to the pre-RQ checkpoint's reason for excluding this analysis."
